{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"Wynne chooses the hooded cloak. “I often use daggers and hand axes. Are there silver modifications available?”","created_at":"2020-07-20T17:45:01.249000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-20T17:45:25.508000Z","id":"734828224835485866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"The oath is set before all the gods found in this room. Our convictions hold divine power like our prayers do. And through our service we believe that we are able to help it grow and help maintain what we can left in the unbalance\" \n(a good hundred or so gods including the shrines and statues)","created_at":"2020-07-20T17:45:07.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734828251121319947","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
